# Number Guessing Game

A simple number guessing game made with Python.

## How to Play
- The computer randomly selects a number between 1 and 100.
- You have to guess the number.
- After every guess, the game will tell you if your number is too high or too low.
- The game continues until you guess the correct number.
- At the end, it shows how many attempts you took.

## How to Run
```bash
python number_guessing_game.py
